  "title": "· New Bags | Mulberry Japan-Exclusive PEANUTS Collaboration: Snoopy & Friends ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Mulberry 日本限定发售 PEANUTS 花生漫画合作系列手袋：史努比和朋友们",
  "excerpt": "Mulberry launches a limited PEANUTS collection in Japan, featuring Snoopy designs on iconic bags in pastel shades.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-08-11",
  "date_label": "August 11, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/u4s75sp/e70f4e300ad291e5.jpg",
  "tags": [],
