    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "From August 12 to August 25, British leather goods house Mulberry will release its new PEANUTS collaboration collection exclusively at Hankyu Umeda Main Store in Japan. The limited lineup comprises 11 pieces, spanning the house's iconic Bayswater bag, the Islington bucket bag, and a mini tote, among others. The designs feature whimsical motifs of Snoopy lounging on a crescent moon under the stars and observing butterflies with Woodstock, all rendered in soft, healing pastel shades of butter yellow, sky blue, and lilac.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
