      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Butter Yellow ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The collaboration spotlights Mulberry's classic Bayswater bag, first introduced in 2003, known for its clean rectangular silhouette and signature Postman's Lock, exuding vintage British charm. These bags are bathed in a sunny butter-yellow hue, with embroidered scenes of Snoopy reclining on a crescent moon 🌙 in quiet contemplation—dreamy, playful, and utterly charming.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
